    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "words": 45,
      "text": "The fifth is the fear of legal excommunication that shall exclude him amongst these who did not receive the hope of God. Also other iniquitous people who shall be found in the church; it excludes them with a legal excommunication, on account of their foolishness.",
